{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of Culture and Wonder\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nIn Tokyo, I marveled at the towering skyscrapers and bustling streets of Shibuya, before finding tranquility in the serene gardens of the Meiji Shrine. The food was, of course, a highlight - from savory ramen to delicate sushi, every meal was a culinary delight.\n\nAs I traveled to Kyoto, I was immersed in the city's rich history and heritage. I strolled through the Fushimi Inari shrine, famous for its thousands of vermilion torii gates, and visited the Kinkaku-ji temple, with its stunning golden pavilion.\n\nOne of the most memorable experiences of my trip was a traditional tea ceremony, where I learned about the intricate rituals and customs surrounding this ancient practice. It was a poignant reminder of the importance of mindfulness and respect in Japanese culture.\n\nAs I left Japan, I felt grateful for the opportunity to experience this fascinating country and its people. The trip was a journey of discovery, not just of a new place, but of a new way of life. I look forward to returning one day and continuing to explore the many wonders that Japan has to offer.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4652870893478394}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.00786387175321579}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.04859800264239311}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.00040987672400660813}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -6.318072337307967e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.03167048096656799}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.01853327639400959}, {"token": " Culture", "logprob": -2.2425925731658936}, {"token": " and"